   342	|---|---|---|---|---|
   343	| A0 | raw $g_{13}$ | pooled | (a) global | V3 status quo |
   344	| A1 | raw | pooled, IPW | (b) | brief option (b) |
   345	| A2 | $T_{\kappa^\star}$ | pooled, IPW | (b) | brief option (c) |
   346	| A3 | raw | config-matched | (d) stratified + hinge | is $T_\kappa$ necessary? (C-B03-A-03) |
   347	| **A4** | $T_{\kappa^\star}$ | config-matched | (d) + hinge + $\lambda$-anchor | **primary proposal** |
   348	| A4−λ | $T_{\kappa^\star}$ | config-matched | (d) + hinge | cost and benefit of the anchor |
   349	| A4-κ½ | $T_{1/2}$ (Froude) | config-matched | (d) + hinge + anchor | κ sensitivity (skipped if $\kappa^\star = \tfrac12$) |
   350	| A4-shuf | $T_{\kappa^\star}$ | blocks with **shuffled** configuration labels, i.e. effectively pooled | (d) | negative control for C-B03-A-01 |
   351	| W | A0 + post-hoc per-configuration whitening | pooled | (a) | anti-gaming control (§3) |
   352	
   353	### 5.5 Metrics
   354	
   355	- **A. Per-group rank.** $\mathrm{PR}_k$ from the unbiased $\widehat U$ on 2,048 held-out outcomes at nominal $w_\sigma$, and $\operatorname{erank}_H$ from the plug-in $\Sigma_B^{(k)}$. Reported for 144 configurations (primary), for 720 configuration × scene cells (reported only), and for aggregates: 5 scenes, 3 tiers, 4 strokes. 95% intervals from 1,000 bootstrap resamples within configuration.
   356	- **B. Successor error.** $\varepsilon^{\mathrm{cm}}_k$, $\varepsilon^{\mathrm{pool}}_k$, and the oracle floor (§5.3). Summaries: worst-configuration maximum and RMS.
   357	- **C. Zero-shot decoding.** Probes (2-layer MLP, 64 hidden units) from frozen $z$ to $T_{\kappa^\star}(g)$ slot groups and $\lambda$, trained on the 28 training seeds and tested on the 8 held-out seeds. $R^2$ per group. Physical $(p, v, \widehat a)_{\mathrm{tip}}$ reconstructed via $T^{-1}$, with relative RMSE.
   358	- **D. Anti-gaming.** A Lipschitz proxy $\ell_{99}$: the 99th percentile of $\|B(g) - B(g')\|/\|\hat g - \hat g'\|$ over within-configuration nearest-neighbour pairs.
   359	- **E. ρ-equivariance residual (for C-B03-A-03).** For arm A3: the $R^2$ of $\lambda$ from first-hidden-layer features, and the relative change in those features under a synthetic $\rho$-rescaling of the tip block at fixed angular outcome.
   360	
