   364	|---|---|---|
   365	| **G1 per-group erank** | $\min_{k\le144}\mathrm{PR}_k \ge 12.0$ (point) **and** every configuration's lower 95% bound $\ge 11.5$. By Rényi monotonicity this implies $\operatorname{erank}_H \ge 12/16$. Scene, tier and stroke aggregates: $\mathrm{PR} \ge 13.0$. **Zero-shot:** $\min\mathrm{PR}_k \ge 12.0$ on the 32 held-out configurations. | yes |
