   370	| **G6 anti-gaming** | $\ell_{99}(\mathrm{A4}) \le 2\times\ell_{99}(\mathrm{A0})$. Arm W must **fail** G4 or G6, which demonstrates that erank-only gates can be gamed. | yes |
